        "content": "{\"reviews\":[{\"review_id\":\"dbdd00a7-ef52-4d13-b2c5-8305c189ace7\",\"review_text\":\"Excellent service ❤️\"},{\"review_id\":\"8421d917-b3db-46e0-aed4-875ce466fa35\",\"review_text\":\"I like the app and I can get my favorite music but I can't download it if am not in premium some body can't get premium I was premium for years but after last update it is just suck and I can't play the music offline\"},{\"review_id\":\"6cf9bf43-7e4b-4229-86cc-9c90075d3639\",\"review_text\":\"I have switched to YouTube music a while ago, and must confess I haven't appreciated this platform. Now I find it is much better. 5 star easy\"},{\"review_id\":\"e064ac8f-9e68-4964-b1f5-7a565c50039a\",\"review_text\":\"Very bad 😂😂😂😂\"},{\"review_id\":\"1aa499c4-1145-403f-9c90-aa086b92e1ec\",\"review_text\":\"why did you remove the shuffle button cuz when I press it, it just pauses like what the heck, you guys suck\"},{\"review_id\":\"642af996-844c-434d-87bc-fc9f26808116\",\"review_text\":\"Premium feature, no helpful at all\"},{\"review_id\":\"3eb93f34-0611-4298-85a2-71abaedd5765\",\"review_text\":\"SO MANY ADS\"},{\"review_id\":\"26d6f7c1-f96a-4838-9dc1-6a678fd41d85\",\"review_text\":\"Going worst with every update\"},{\"review_id\":\"1f2a183c-bdc8-4f77-aeb8-1d564bc3bf4e\",\"review_text\":\"Unbelievable that the app just starts playing whenever it decides!!!!!\"},{\"review_id\":\"8948f1b1-8e98-4d0d-b8f6-788a8790ce7b\",\"review_text\":\"Premium for everything. I hope spotify will not ask for premium to uninstall this from my phone.. Thanks Spotify team... I'm happily uninstalling this app from my phone. 😂\"}]}"
